<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.8">
<l>nāṭoṟum vīṭiṉṟiyē toḻakkūṭuṅko ṉaṉṉutalī</l>
<l>rāṭuṟu tīṅkarumpum viḷaicennelu mākiyeṅku</l>
<l>māṭuṟu pūntaṭañcēr vayalcūḻtaṇ ṭiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>nīṭuṟai kiṉṟapirā ṉilantāviya nīḷkaḻalē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Is it possible to worship everyday, without leaving off, you with good foreheads,</l>
<l>the long anklet[ed_feet] that crossed the earth of the lord who for long has dwelt</l>
<l>in cool Tiruvallavāḻ surrounded by paddy fields joined by tanks with luxuriant flowers,</l> 
<l>everywhere, there being dancing sweet sugarcane too and ripening red paddy?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
